        "If you miss, he sends lightning over the floor. Stand on one of the emblems in the corners to stay out of its reach. 3 hits end this phase.",
        "Next he floats overhead and throws balls of energy. Swing your sword to send each one back until a return hits him, then slash him while he is down. An empty **Bottle** also bats the ball back.",
