        "After enough damage you get the Master Sword back. He then adds lightning and ground slams. Hit the glowing weak points on his forearms after a slam.",
        "Once both forearms are broken he is enraged and cannot be hurt. Run while Zelda prepares. She then opens a weak point on his forehead: shoot it with **Light Arrows** after a slam, about 4 hits.",
